#: ../../library/time.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`time` --- time related functions"
msgstr ":mod:`time` --- funkcije povezane s vremenom"

#: ../../library/time.rst:7
msgid ""
"The ``time`` module provides functions for getting the current time and "
"date, measuring time intervals, and for delays."
msgstr ""
"Modul ``time`` pruža funkcije za dohvaćanje trenutnog vremena i datuma, "
"mjerenje vremenskih intervala i za odgode."

#: ../../library/time.rst:10
msgid ""
"**Time Epoch**: The Alif- and i.MX RT-based OpenMV Cams use the POSIX epoch "
"of 1970-01-01 00:00:00 UTC. The STM32-based OpenMV Cams use an epoch of "
"2000-01-01 00:00:00 UTC. The epoch year can be determined at runtime with "
"``gmtime(0)[0]``."
msgstr ""
"**Vremenska epoha**\\ : OpenMV Cam temeljene na Alif i i.MX RT koriste POSIX"
" epohu 1970-01-01 00:00:00 UTC. OpenMV Cam temeljene na STM32 koriste epohu "
"2000-01-01 00:00:00 UTC. Godina epohe može se odrediti tijekom izvođenja "
"pomoću ``gmtime(0)[0]``\\ ."

#: ../../library/time.rst:15
msgid ""
"**Maintaining actual calendar date/time**: This requires a Real Time Clock "
"(RTC). On the OpenMV Cam the system time is provided by the "
":class:`machine.RTC` object. The current calendar time may be set with "
"``machine.RTC().datetime(tuple)`` and is maintained by one of:"
msgstr ""
"**Održavanje stvarnog kalendarskog datuma/vremena**\\ : Ovo zahtijeva sat "
"stvarnog vremena (RTC). Na OpenMV Cam sistemsko vrijeme pruža objekt "
":class:`machine.RTC`\\ . Trenutno kalendarsko vrijeme može se postaviti "
"pomoću ``machine.RTC().datetime(tuple)`` i održava se jednim od sljedećih "
"načina:"

#: ../../library/time.rst:20
msgid "A backup battery (an optional component on some OpenMV Cams)."
msgstr "Pomoćna baterija (neobavezna komponenta na nekim OpenMV Cam)."

#: ../../library/time.rst:21
msgid ""
"A networked time protocol such as :mod:`ntptime` (requires a network "
"connection)."
msgstr ""
"Mrežni vremenski protokol poput :mod:`ntptime` (zahtijeva mrežnu vezu)."

#: ../../library/time.rst:23
msgid ""
"Setting it manually on each power-up. The RTC is then typically maintained "
"across soft resets, but is lost on power loss unless a backup battery is "
"fitted."
msgstr ""
"Ručno postavljanje pri svakom uključivanju. RTC se tada obično održava "
"tijekom mekih ponovnih pokretanja, ali se gubi pri gubitku napajanja osim "
"ako je ugrađena pomoćna baterija."

#: ../../library/time.rst:27
msgid ""
"If the calendar time is not maintained, the functions below that reference "
"the current absolute time will not behave as expected."
msgstr ""
"Ako se kalendarsko vrijeme ne održava, funkcije navedene u nastavku koje se "
"referiraju na trenutno apsolutno vrijeme neće se ponašati kako se očekuje."

#: ../../library/time.rst:31
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "Funkcije"

#: ../../library/time.rst:36
msgid ""
"Convert the time *secs* expressed in seconds since the Epoch (see above) "
"into an 8-tuple which contains: ``(year, month, mday, hour, minute, second, "
"weekday, yearday)`` If *secs* is not provided or None, then the current time"
" from the RTC is used."
msgstr ""
"Pretvara vrijeme *secs* izraženo u sekundama od epohe (vidi gore) u 8-torku "
"koja sadrži: ``(year, month, mday, hour, minute, second, weekday, yearday)``"
" Ako *secs* nije naveden ili je None, tada se koristi trenutno vrijeme iz "
"RTC-a."

#: ../../library/time.rst:40
msgid ""
"The `gmtime()` function returns a date-time tuple in UTC, and `localtime()` "
"returns a date-time tuple in local time."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija `gmtime()` vraća n-torku datuma i vremena u UTC-u, a `localtime()` "
"vraća n-torku datuma i vremena u lokalnom vremenu."

